  message: "Residual filed as WI-mirus: the under-count (websocket-linker reports 2 while reading 405) and the field overload (route-handler-linker stores a ROUTE count in files_analyzed). Both survive PR #1005 because its stamp is guarded -- a body that assigned the field keeps its value -- and both have a plausible legitimate reading, so they need a decision about what the field means rather than a repair. 15 of the 17 self-assigning linkers are unmeasured, not clean."  # dc6a
